# A name a macro declares it binds for its call's text (## binds: it)
# is the macro's: the call's text cannot bind it again (MC30).
== SOURCE
"x:" u_se< "Macros"
"3 + 4" x:w_ith< "'{ it -> it * 2 } e_ach it"
== ERROR
error[shadows-anaphor]: it is bound by x:w_ith< for this text (## binds: it); the text cannot bind it again: use another name
 --> -e:2:18
  |
2 | "3 + 4" x:w_ith< "'{ it -> it * 2 } e_ach it"
  |                  ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
